{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02469",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 8.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Okay, so hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.11,
      "end_seconds": 14.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.37,
      "end_seconds": 20.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Well, I've been having sudden confusion over a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.29,
      "end_seconds": 25.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.01,
      "end_seconds": 31.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "It's, It's been six months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.83,
      "end_seconds": 35.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.49,
      "end_seconds": 54.11,
      "duration_seconds": 16.62,
      "text": "Seeing things that aren't there goes along with it, most of the time. The seeing things that aren't there? That's been for two days. About seeing things that aren't there, I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.09,
      "end_seconds": 73.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "And what about weakness on one side, head injury or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.46,
      "end_seconds": 77.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.05,
      "end_seconds": 82.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.59,
      "end_seconds": 88.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.04,
      "end_seconds": 93.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.47,
      "end_seconds": 96.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.26,
      "end_seconds": 112.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Okay, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.84,
      "end_seconds": 118.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Um, no, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.72,
      "end_seconds": 126.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.7,
      "end_seconds": 129.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.05,
      "end_seconds": 135.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.96,
      "end_seconds": 140.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Amlodipine. I take it 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.22,
      "end_seconds": 158.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.65,
      "end_seconds": 161.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.38,
      "end_seconds": 164.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Right, do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.87,
      "end_seconds": 170.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.97,
      "end_seconds": 174.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.31,
      "end_seconds": 177.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.68,
      "end_seconds": 182.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.47,
      "end_seconds": 192.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.51,
      "end_seconds": 213.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 111 over 71, temperature 39.0, respiratory rate 20, pulse 108."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.55,
      "end_seconds": 218.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.56,
      "end_seconds": 229.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.03,
      "end_seconds": 234.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.45,
      "end_seconds": 251.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "She is drowsy, hot, disoriented, and her blood pressure is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.24,
      "end_seconds": 276.95,
      "duration_seconds": 20.71,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. So where does that leave us? It points towards delirium from an infection. I want a urine dipstick done, that's for acute confusion. She needs to go to hospital today for fluids and antibiotics. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.64,
      "end_seconds": 280.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.18,
      "end_seconds": 284.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Come back straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.68,
      "end_seconds": 287.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.18,
      "end_seconds": 295.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.5,
      "end_seconds": 300.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.94,
      "end_seconds": 306.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.33,
      "end_seconds": 314.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}